[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Out of Control]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.76]What was the danger? | 危险是什么？
[00:14.45]As the man tried to swing the speedboat round, the steering wheel came away in his hands. | 当那个人试图让快艇转弯时，方向盘从他手中脱落了。
[00:22.55]He waved desperately to his companion, who had been water skiing for the last fifteen minutes. | 他拼命地向他的同伴挥手，他的同伴在过去的15分钟里一直在滑水。
[00:30.82]Both men had hardly had time to realize what was happening when they were thrown violently into the sea. | 两个人还没来得及意识到发生了什么，就猛地被抛入了海里。
[00:40.90]The speedboat had struck a buoy, but it continued to move very quickly across the water. | 快艇撞上了一个浮标，但它继续快速地在水面上行驶。
[00:49.20]Both men had just begun to swim towards the shore, | 两个人刚刚开始向岸边游去，
[00:53.93]when they noticed with dismay that the speedboat was moving in a circle. | 这时他们惊愕地发现快艇正在兜圈子。
[01:00.07]It now came straight towards them at tremendous speed. | 它现在正以惊人的速度直冲他们而来。
[01:05.95]In less than a minute, it roared past them only a few feet away. | 不到1分钟，它呼啸着从他们身边几英尺处驶过。
[01:13.18]After it had passed, they swam on as quickly as they could because they knew that the boat would soon return. | 过去之后，他们尽快地继续向前游，因为他们知道快艇很快就会转回来。
[01:23.52]They had just had enough time to swim out of danger when the boat again completed a circle. | 他们刚刚游离危险区，快艇就又转完了一圈。
[01:32.13]On this occasion, however, it had slowed down considerably. | 然而这次它的速度已大大减慢了。
[01:38.41]The petrol had nearly all been used up. | 汽油几乎快用光了。
[01:42.60]Before long, the noise dropped completely and the boat began to drift gently across the water. | 不久，发动机的声音完全消失了，小艇开始在水面上缓慢地漂流。
